WEBVTT

00:13:28.654 --> 00:13:32.495
ali ponesite sa sobom djelić ovoga
i barem malo drugačije razmišljajte o tome

00:13:32.495 --> 00:13:35.736
jer raznolikost je čarobna.

00:13:35.736 --> 00:13:39.554
Zanemarite svoje prve dojmove

00:13:39.554 --> 00:13:41.378
jer bih se dala okladiti

00:13:41.378 --> 00:13:43.199
da su vjerojatno pogrešne.

00:13:43.199 --> 00:13:45.624
Hvala.

00:13:45.624 --> 00:13:49.015
(Pljesak)